 Pepper|black pepper]]\n* ¼ cup dried [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n* ⅓ cup granulated [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Chipotle Pepper|chipotle powder]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] hickory smoke powder (if you can't find this, use 2 drops liquid smoke in the dish.)\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all ingredients and store in a cool, dark place in an airtight container.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for spice mixes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paprika]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dehydrated lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chipotle chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using liquid smoke]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Chop Rub","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup smoked paprika","sourceText":"1 cup smoked paprika","amountText":"1 cup smoked paprika","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup salt","sourceText":"½ cup salt","amountText":"½ cup salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 cup dark brown sugar","sourceText":"1 cup dark brown sugar","amountText":"1 cup dark brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¾ cup dehydrated lemon peel","sourceText":"¾ cup dehydrated lemon peel","amountText":"¾ cup dehydrated lemon peel","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ cup black pepper","sourceText":"½ cup black pepper","amountText":"½ cup black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"¼ cup dried rosemary","sourceText":"¼ cup dried rosemary","amountText":"¼ cup dried rosemary","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"⅓ cup granulated garlic","sourceText":"⅓ cup granulated garlic","amountText":"⅓ cup granulated garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"s